{"ticker":"TER","updated":"2026-10-30T23:15:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Teradyne, Inc.","shortName":"Teradyne, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.teradyne.com","fullTimeEmployees":6600,"marketCap":42895212544,"trailingPE":31.536781,"forwardPE":23.056805,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.57772,"pegRatio":0.54,"targetMeanPrice":424.66666,"targetHighPrice":550.0,"targetLowPrice":340.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.698,"earningsGrowth":1.893,"grossMargins":0.59306,"operatingMargins":0.30903998,"profitMargins":0.27457002,"totalRevenue":5000771072,"beta":1.747,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":487.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":151.52,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.18},"summary":"Teradyne, Inc. engages in the design, development, manufacture, and sale of automated test systems and robotics products in the United States, Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. The company operates through Semiconductor Test, Robotics, and Other segments. The Semiconductor Test segment offers products and services for wafer level and device package testing, and system level testing of semiconductor devices in automotive, industrial, communications, consumer, smartphones, cloud, computer and electronic game, and other applications. This segment also provides FLEX test platform systems; J750 test system to address the volume semiconductor devices, including microcontrollers; Magnum platform that tests memory devices, such as flash memory and DRAM; and ETS platform for semiconductor manufacturers, and assembly and test subcontractors in the analog/mixed signal markets. It serves integrated device manufacturers that integrate the fabrication of silicon wafers into their business; fabless companies that outsource the manufacturing of silicon wafers; foundries; and semiconductor assembly and test providers. The Robotics segment provides collaborative robotic arms and autonomous mobile robots for manufacturing, logistics, and industrial customers. It also provides product test instruments which includes operations related to the design, manufacturing and marketing of ","summary_zh":"Teradyne, Inc. 在美國、亞太地區、歐洲、中東和非洲從事自動化測試系統和機器人產品的設計、開發、製造和銷售。該公司透過半導體測試、機器人和其他部門運作。半導體測試部門提供用於汽車、工業、通訊、消費性、智慧型手機、雲端、電腦和電子遊戲以及其他應用中的半導體裝置的晶圓級和裝置封裝測試以及系統級測試的產品和服務。該部門還提供FLEX測試平台系統； J750測試系統可尋址大量半導體裝置，包括微控制器； Magnum平台，用於測試快閃記憶體和DRAM等儲存設備；為半導體製造商以及類比/混合訊號市場的組裝和測試分包商提供 ETS 平台。它為將矽晶圓製造整合到其業務中的整合裝置製造商提供服務；外包矽晶圓製造的無晶圓廠公司；鑄造廠；以及半導體組裝和測試供應商。機器人部門為製造、物流和工業客戶提供協作機械手臂和自主移動機器人。它還提供產品測試儀器，包括與設計、製造和行銷相關的業務","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":116.19,"h":121.04,"l":114.5,"c":120.61,"v":3626800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":120.77,"h":122.12,"l":118.39,"c":119.63,"v":3212700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":117.85,"h":120.02,"l":116.0,"c":119.39,"v":3136900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":120.06,"h":123.44,"l":119.37,"c":120.2,"v":3531600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":120.21,"h":121.26,"l":117.59,"c":118.9,"v":3738100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":119.0,"h":120.0,"l":114.65,"c":115.07,"v":4724500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":114.88,"h":118.12,"l":113.11,"c":117.82,"v":4412000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":117.82,"h":118.78,"l":114.43,"c":115.56,"v":4023900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":115.0,"h":115.18,"l":109.56,"c":112.24,"v":5904200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":112.25,"h":114.29,"l":110.91,"c":114.07,"v":3241300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":114.3,"h":115.61,"l":113.39,"c":113.93,"v":2871200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":113.75,"h":116.34,"l":112.81,"c":114.32,"v":2569300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":117.78,"h":119.53,"l":115.09,"c":118.82,"v":4876800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":119.5,"h":120.6,"l":117.54,"c":119.85,"v":9576500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":126.46,"h":135.48,"l":126.02,"c":135.18,"v":7137400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":136.0,"h":138.24,"l":133.18,"c":134.68,"v":4341200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":134.51,"h":134.67,"l":131.03,"c":133.21,"v":3688700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":131.36,"h":133.15,